  <!-- I. Pterodactyl (Beli Panel Hosting Otomatis) -->
  <section class="mb-8" id="sec-pterodactyl">
    <h2 class="text-base mb-1 font-medium text-gray-800">I. Pterodactyl — Beli Panel Hosting Otomatis</h2>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] font-medium text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Fitur ini menjual akses panel hosting (Pterodactyl) secara otomatis. Admin mengatur server panel (domain + API key) dan paket (RAM/Disk/CPU/Harga) di menu Admin &rarr; Pterodactyl.
      User beli paket pakai saldo; sistem otomatis membuatkan akun &amp; server di panel (username, password, email), dan transaksinya tersimpan di database.
      Alur pemakaian: <b>pilih server &rarr; pilih paket &rarr; beli &rarr; cek status/riwayat</b>. Panel punya masa expired (auto delete server &amp; user) dan berstatus NON GARANSI.
    </p>

    <!-- I1. Daftar Server Panel -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">1. Daftar Server Panel</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-4">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroPanels" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/panels</span></li>
    </ul>

    <!-- I2. Daftar Paket -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">2. Daftar Paket</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-2">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroPackages" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/packages</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Parameter:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-4">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">apikey</span> (string, wajib)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">panel_id</span> (opsional) — filter paket milik satu server panel</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- I3. Daftar Egg -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">3. Daftar Egg (Pilihan Egg) <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal">(opsional)</span></p>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] font-medium text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-2">
      Mengambil daftar egg (tipe software, mis. Node.js, Python, dll) yang tersedia di <b>Nest</b> server panel tersebut. Nest mengikuti pengaturan admin: kalau paket punya Nest khusus dipakai Nest paket, kalau tidak dipakai Nest default server panel. Pakai <span class="text-blue-600">id</span> egg dari hasil endpoint ini sebagai <span class="text-blue-600">egg_id</span> di endpoint Beli Panel.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-2">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroEggs" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/eggs</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Parameter:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-4">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">apikey</span> (string, wajib)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">panel_id</span> (wajib) — dari endpoint Daftar Server Panel</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">package_id</span> (opsional) — dari endpoint Daftar Paket. Kirim kalau mau daftar egg mengikuti Nest &amp; egg default paket tersebut</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Contoh Request (cURL):</p>
    <div class="relative bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md p-3 mb-4">
      <pre class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed">curl -s '<span class="base-url-placeholder">BASE_URL</span>/api/pterodactyl/eggs?apikey=YOUR_API_KEY&amp;panel_id=650f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d&amp;package_id=650f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0e'</pre>
    </div>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Contoh Response:</p>
    <div class="relative bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md p-3 mb-3">
      <pre class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed">{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "panel_id": "650f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d",
    "package_id": "650f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0e",
    "nest_id": 5,
    "default_egg_id": 15,
    "eggs": [
      { "id": 15, "name": "Nodejs Generic", "is_default": true },
      { "id": 16, "name": "Python Generic", "is_default": false }
    ]
  }
}</pre>
    </div>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-4">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">nest_id</span> — Nest yang dipakai (Nest paket kalau diset, kalau tidak Nest default server panel)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">default_egg_id</span> — egg default yang dipakai kalau <span class="text-blue-600">egg_id</span> tidak dikirim di Beli Panel</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">eggs</span> — semua egg di Nest tersebut (<span class="text-blue-600">is_default</span> = true untuk egg default)</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- I4. Beli Panel -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">4. Beli Panel</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-2">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroOrder" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/order</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Parameter:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-4">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">apikey</span> (string, wajib)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">panel_id</span> (wajib) — dari endpoint Daftar Server Panel</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">package_id</span> (wajib) — dari endpoint Daftar Paket</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">username</span> (wajib) — huruf/angka/underscore, 3-20 karakter</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">email</span> (wajib) — email pemilik akun panel</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">password</span> (opsional) — 8-32 karakter tanpa spasi. Kalau tidak dikirim, password dibuatkan otomatis (acak &amp; aman) dan dikembalikan di response.</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">egg_id</span> (opsional) — pilih tipe software/egg tertentu, ambil <span class="text-blue-600">id</span>-nya dari endpoint Daftar Egg (harus salah satu egg yang ada di Nest paket/server tersebut). Kalau tidak dikirim atau id-nya tidak valid, otomatis pakai egg default paket/server.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-600 font-medium mb-4">Saldo otomatis terpotong sesuai harga paket. Kalau pembuatan akun/server gagal, saldo otomatis dikembalikan.</p>

    <!-- I5. Cek Status -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">5. Cek Status Transaksi</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-2">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroStatus" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/status</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Parameter:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-4">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">apikey</span> (string, wajib)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">id</span> (wajib) — ID transaksi dari endpoint Beli Panel</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- I6. Klaim Garansi -->
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-1">6. Klaim Garansi</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-1 font-medium mb-2">
      <li>Method: <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">GET</span></li>
      <li>URL: <span id="urlPteroClaim" class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">/api/pterodactyl/claim-warranty</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Parameter:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 ml-4 font-medium mb-2">
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">apikey</span> (string, wajib)</li>
      <li><span class="text-blue-600 text-[13.5px]">id</span> (wajib) — ID transaksi</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-600 font-medium mb-5">Panel sekarang NON GARANSI, jadi endpoint ini selalu menolak klaim. Panel otomatis dihapus saat masa expired (<code>expiresAt</code>) habis.</p>

    <p class="text-[13.5px] text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">Contoh Alur (Node.js):</p>
